<title>UK: Shell chemicals profit to remain weak in 97.</title>
<headline>Shell chemicals profit to remain weak in 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc said on Thursday that despite some signs of better cracker margins, it expects industry margins and profitability to remain weak throughout 1997.  </p>
<p>It said in a statement accompanying fourth quarter figures that results for chemicals in 1996 reflected only a modest recovery in the petrochemical industry from the poor trading conditions experienced in late 1995.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
